      1.5625e-05
     ],
     "construction": "meshes.disk_graded: polar grid about the origin with radial nodes rho_i (2n uniform intervals on [0, r0], 4n uniform on [r0, Rb]) and angles th_j (4n uniform intervals on [0, pi/2], th from +z); the fan at the origin is the triangles (origin, (1, j), (1, j+1)); every other quad (i, j), (i+1, j), (i+1, j+1), (i, j+1) is split along the diagonal (i, j)-(i+1, j+1) into [(i,j),(i+1,j),(i+1,j+1)] and [(i,j),(i+1,j+1),(i,j+1)]; then x -> e + (x - e)(|x - e|/Rg)^(beta-1) for |x - e| < Rg = r0/2 about the rim e = (r0, 0); a z = 0 facet is disk iff both vertices have r <= r0 (else insulating plane); P2: only the outer-arc edge node curved (radial projection of the chord midpoint), all other edge nodes straight; verified by vertex and connectivity hashes",
